<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-22T13:58:26.528Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:58:26 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador has launched a military operation in Haiti to free four kidnapped aviation technicians, while President Bukele has threatened Haitian gangs over the abduction of Salvadoran soldiers. Haitian gangs have taken four Salvadoran soldiers hostage, and four international troops remain missing after a gang ambush. Haitian migrants have reshaped a US town, and a mayor warned of a massacre that was ignored. The conflict caused 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/22/el-salvador-launches-military-operation-in-haiti-to-free-four-kidnapped-aviation-technicia&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9md1E4bHpDeEhnRDVKcTFaak1zcEtqeE5JaGthSmU2YVFicGZaZTBuVzNYXzZweXdlTkttTnFnT01yeWRnZFE3ZDdlQ2l0LTV6SUtDMmdZZ0FnSVFtWHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPaFlEUDZDeTkwaUxqVFFsUHZvQkJDd3U3R2NqZDY0bmE1ZDg1dE9EVUgzV3g5ZHlkcWs2UXRETmxERkd5dEZxM0ZoWk5JUWJJNGZmNUlNcUNTbllpdW1jS1RFVDdYVk4xajNuTUtZaWFLNUZzeWdFNVdpeVFkdHplZGxFVkJvNUZmR2JqS3NHeTFGQmI3aUlONmVITVJURG4yODdRMUVndzAzUlI0N1ljVFNidWN5SzEwd0RERGdkQXJBLWlh?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNbnNPWk1hOHlha3lWTlRSOC12b2JCeG9XczlqSnZXQXBQZGtZaHQzb1BCOWdsM3JqOFJ4T1dPR29RUDhVTDFNeTE0YUNiVFc3TkZ6NlZrN2xXTld6VTNGM3d3ZzZadWVVWFhwU0Q5N2NKUC1oa0hJWWpVY082cHVWQlk1QXFPRXVoZ2hEMXE0b00?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPRUFEakRnZjRqRG1ReDZMZ3huOWxnYnkzREZjdUhndG5wTUp0VDhvREdaSTY2ek5KYWw5ZThsSHNtWVRFd3J1b3AtME5jekdsa2VTVGdsZkpQTjV3LWZhblZVZjZMcldTVGxXZ1ZMeGVITlFaQXJNdFZIQ21mSXF